r then runs bin/fm-session-start.sh. After verified transfer, end this turn and retire the predecessor session. If both attempts fail within ten minutes, the launcher emits handoff_failed; report that failure instead of claiming readiness. A failure with reason=unresolved is not final: a later handoff_ack with reason=lock_transferred for the same nonce means the transfer committed. Do not run /compact. This instruction fires once per session."
